# One entry per line: a podcast or audiobook ID, an episode ID, or the random
# 10-character ID in a feed URL. Feeds and episode downloads whose URL contains
# an entry return 410 Gone. Matching ignores case and percent-encoding. Episode
# links carry no podcast ID, so to stop ones podcatchers already have, list the
# episode IDs. Only the first word of a line counts; lines starting with '#' and
# empty lines are ignored.
1234567890
abcdefghij

